  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Instructional affine projection of two infinite planes alpha/beta sharing line b, with a in beta parallel to b. Complete finite patch boundaries include rear alpha and upper beta broken spans. Very light neutral patch fills and straightened boundary strokes are modern layout regularization, not metric plane givens. No projection crossing is introduced as a named spatial point; plane perpendicularity and equal lengths are not asserted.",
  "source": {
    "image": {"path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-19.png", "sha256": "d25e282b0d3e79fc8b02b529183eaf4cf0a6823a47949053134887d878c458d9"},
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "证明：先讨论 $a\\not\\subset\\alpha$ 的情形（图19）。\n首先，直线 $b$ 和 $a$ 都在平面 $\\beta$ 内；\n其次，直线 $a$ 不可能与直线 $b$ 相交，否则 $a$ 就会与平面 $\\alpha$ 相交，因此 $b\\mathbin{//}a$。\n\n对于 $a\\subset\\alpha$ 的情形，定理显然成立。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "已知：\n$a\\mathbin{//}\\alpha$，\n$a\\subset\\beta$，\n$\\beta\\cap\\alpha=b$。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "求证：\n$b\\mathbin{//}a$。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "图 19"}
    ],
